### Lemon Law Lawyers San Jose California

## Learn Your Rights Under San Jose Lemon Law

If you’ve been on the road in San Jose during rush hour, you know just how important it is to have a properly functioning vehicle. Traffic is bad enough, but a faulty car is the “lemon” on top of an already sour experience.

Lemon vehicles are cars that don’t work properly due to substandard manufacturing. Anyone can get stuck with them, even if you make sure to purchase from responsible sellers. That’s why the California lemon law exists. It protects San Jose drivers if they do wind up with a defective vehicle.

The Song Beverly Consumer Warranty Act (California lemon law) holds manufacturers accountable for the defective cars they sell. At CLINE APC, our expert attorneys educate local clients on our state’s lemon law, as well as the process for receiving fair compensation through the legal system.

The following factors indicate manufacturer mistakes entitle you to a refund or replacement under San Jose lemon law:

- The vehicle manufacturer has made at least two or more attempts to repair a warranty-covered defect

- The vehicle has been out of service for more than 30 days while being repaired for warranty-covered problems

- The vehicle has several warranty-covered problems, which were not caused by the unreasonable or unauthorized use of the vehicle by the consumer

It’s important to note that there is a California lemon law time limit for seeking compensation with the aid of a lemon lawyer in San Jose. Your lemon car’s defect must first occur within the defined terms of the manufacturer or dealer warranty.

Despite the common misunderstanding, your vehicle’s issue does not need to be addressed within the first 18 months after purchase or before the odometer reaches 18,000 miles. The 18-month / 18,000-mile window is a lemon-law presumption, not a requirement. It does not decide whether you have a good case. What matters is whether the defect first occurred during the original manufacturer warranty.

When your vehicle meets California lemon law requirements, you’re entitled to:

Manufacturer coverage of your San Jose lemon law lawyer and court costs A full refund of the vehicle’s original purchase price A replacement vehicle if necessary The process of obtaining your lemon buyback value is not always simple. For consumers who don’t seek out the help of a specialized [lemon lawyer California](/), manufacturers will often create unnecessary hurdles or openly deny your rights.

